[{"title":"寄陈正叔","author":"赵秉文","text":"渺渺西风去翼轻，霜林枫叶动秋声。\n嵩邛竞秀容多峭，河洛争流忌独清。\n广武山川留故垒，成皋草木閟空城。\n凭高一掬英雄泪，付与穷途阮步兵。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":640,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"赠磨镜李先生","author":"赵秉文","text":"自笑年来白发公，丹砂不肯借颜红。\n分无海上三山药，来访人间百岁翁。\n黄渎何曾涴明月，青天元不碍冥鸿。\n何时相约丹元子，便欲因之乘晓风。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":641,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"记梦","author":"赵秉文","text":"六年京国鬓尘黄，一望家山一断肠。\n病后始知谋退晚，梦中犹记和诗忙。\n风来竹里娟娟好，水过花间冉冉香。\n学道无成还自笑，人生习气果难忘。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":642,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"登天寿阁","author":"赵秉文","text":"人间赤日无处避，天上云居即宝坊。\n鸟飞无碍长空阔，人意自生高阁凉。\n风来为作不请友，午梦径到无何乡。\n黄昏索马出门去，犹望东华尘土黄。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":643,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"和刘云卿","author":"赵秉文","text":"屏山殁后使人悲，此外交亲我与雷。\n千里老怀何日写，一生笑口几回开。\n心知契阔留陈土，时复登临上吹台。\n目极天低雁回处，西风忽送好诗来。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":644,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"和种竹","author":"赵秉文","text":"君家种竹五七个，我亦近栽三数竿。\n两地平分风月破，大家留待雪霜看。\n土膏生色叶犹卷，客枕梦魂声已寒。\n见此又思君子面，何时相对倚栏干。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":645,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"寄元裕之","author":"赵秉文","text":"久雨新晴散痹顽，一轩凉思坐中间。\n树头风泻无穷水，天末云移不定山。\n宦味渐思生处乐，人生难得老来閒。\n紫芝眉宇何时见，谁与嵩山共往还。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":646,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送宋飞卿二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"雄豪两妙秀而文，不独吾云人亦云。\n贺监早知仙李白，薛宣那得吏朱云。\n秋风汴水伤今别，明月邠郊与子分。\n瘦李髯雷隔存殁，只愁诗垒不能军。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":647,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送宋飞卿二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"未能免俗聊从宦，遥望孤云忆旧庐。\n不乐径归真吏隐，得闲随分寄僧居。\n关山牢落三年梦，行李萧条一束书。\n想见莲花峰下遇，路人遥指倒骑驴。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":648,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"至日次刘云卿韵","author":"赵秉文","text":"此生天地一陈人，百岁三分过二分。\n老去光阴空惜日，愁来世事独看云。\n静中剥复观消长，身外荣枯任纠纷。\n犹有忧时心未已，卧听儿诵战场文。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":649,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"百五日独游西园","author":"赵秉文","text":"西园启钥起芳尘，满眼风光不属春。\n楼阁人非空似旧，蹊山岁久却成真。\n断桥没板横斜艇，古木欹垣碍去轮。\n老去搜诗厌彫斲，晚风吹水白鳞鳞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":650,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"题王摩诘画明皇剑阁图","author":"赵秉文","text":"剑阁森危隔锦官，云间栈路细盘盘。\n天回日驭长安远，雨滴铃声蜀道难。\n当日六军同驻马，他时万里独回銮。\n伤心凝碧池头句，有底工夫作画看。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":651,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"和钦止河中即事","author":"赵秉文","text":"鹳鹊楼前一望时，长河寂寞送斜晖。\n人歌人哭几兴废，年去年来今是非。\n寒雨渭流人断渡，秋风汾水雁来稀。\n千村万落人烟霭，更许砧声暮捣衣。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":652,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"吊袁用之","author":"赵秉文","text":"卜筑中条四十秋，安排佳处近休休。\n隐居境为王官胜，仙伯名因少室留。\n架上残书灰烬冷，囊中妙药鬼神偷。\n伤心天柱峰头月，曾照先生杖屦游。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":653,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"古瓶蜡梅","author":"赵秉文","text":"石冷铜腥苦未清，瓦壶温水照轻明。\n土花晕碧龙纹涩，烛泪痕疏雁字横。\n未许功名归鼎鼐，且收风月入瓶罂。\n娇黄唤起昭阳梦，汉苑凄凉草棘生。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":654,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雪意","author":"赵秉文","text":"门巷萧条日易曛，豆秸灰欲落江云。\n眼花淡淡初疑见，耳重萧萧竟不闻。\n便可一杯平体粟，不须六出点衣纹。\n慇勤急遣蓬莱使，探到梅花破几分。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":655,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"栗","author":"赵秉文","text":"渔阳上谷晚风寒，秋入霜林栗玉乾。\n未析棕榈封万壳，乍分混沌出双丸。\n宾朋宴罢煨秋熟，儿女灯前爆夜阑。\n千树侯封等尘土，且随园芋劝加餐。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":656,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"忆橙","author":"赵秉文","text":"怅望天涯驿骑尘，政须玉甲破芳新。\n可怜虚度梅梢月，无计相陪竹叶春。\n三日手香频入梦，一年秋好不关身。\n快须准备新诗句，傥有金苞赠故人。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":657,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"射虎","author":"赵秉文","text":"眼光百步透林寒，抵死嗔人守九关。\n只道草中藏白额，岂知世上有黄间。\n才闻父老愁三害，倏见熊罴寝一班。\n寄谢咸阳叹黄犬，何如雾豹隐南山。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":658,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"冬至","author":"赵秉文","text":"天时人事不难量，消尽群阴又一阳。\n千里家山凭梦到，数茎白发为愁长。\n老来度日惟经卷，病后关心祗药方。\n六十之年今过五，不须苦死问行藏。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":659,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"菊二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"水冷云疏木叶黄，绕篱目送雁南翔。\n酒倾桑落林庐静，秋入骚人齿颊香。\n人惜后期沾雨露，天教晚节傲风霜。\n凭谁寄语陶元亮，不为南山兴自长。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":660,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"菊二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"西风吹叶静千林，独有幽香伴苦吟。\n细叶宫槐舒碧皱，小花佛顶晕黄深。\n谁怜细雨情何限，可忍清霜瘦不禁。\n寄语儿曹莫轻折，重阳留待付孤斟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":661,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"九月十一日夜对月","author":"赵秉文","text":"无花无酒过重阳，转觉闲居兴味长。\n明月岂随人薄厚，黄花不逐世炎凉。\n闰年节晚初过雁，老境衾寒知有霜。\n清境唤回蝴蝶梦，起寻竹影据胡床。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":662,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"答赵庆之节使","author":"赵秉文","text":"故人别后定何如，春雁来时忽寄书。\n壮岁从军几人在，老来分守五年馀。\n挂冠无计追弘景，襆被何时从魏舒。\n遥想西州贤父老，瓜畴闲伴故侯锄。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":663,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"题刘莱州像","author":"赵秉文","text":"当年二老赵张俦，独许先生第一流。\n异政曾闻山鬼伏，直声须向古人求。\n从来走卒知司马，到处儿童说细侯。\n惆怅当年旧游处，羊昙不肯过西州。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":664,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"九日会极目亭","author":"赵秉文","text":"孤亭高压冷云堆，九日登临贳酒杯。\n魏国河山残照在，梁王台殿野花开。\n鸥从白水明边没，雁向青天尽处回。\n未必龙山如此会，座中三馆尽英才。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":665,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"再和","author":"赵秉文","text":"秋兴高于滟滪堆，秋光并入阮公杯。\n霜凋蒲剑三棱折，雨裂荷衣十字开。\n北雁远浮梁水动，南云低抱楚天回。\n前年此日登高会，点检唯无短李才。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":666,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"过杨太尉坟","author":"赵秉文","text":"道傍古冢入荒榛，下马摩娑汉八分。\n谁谓皇天无老眼，却令大鸟泣孤坟。\n独携一盏霜风酒，共酹三峰日暮云。\n李杜就诛钩党起，可能天下独伤君。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":667,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"过邠州二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"地灵物秀古称雄，前有汾阳后范公。\n千古山川形胜地，两朝人物画图中。\n一家忠厚馀风化，七月蚕桑咏女功。\n谁识圣贤遗意在，黍离篇末继豳风。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":668,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"过邠州二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"遥看泾水绕城流，下尽陂陀始见州。\n岁暮简书催出塞，天寒风雪送行舟。\n坡田井井龟图画，山路盘盘篆印缪。\n更欲慇勤访陈迹，夜深灯火伴牢愁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":669,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"过庆阳","author":"赵秉文","text":"地形占得古金汤，感叹当时几战场。\n父子一家三范帅，功名异代两汾阳。\n四山带郭环天险，二水分流会女墙。\n想见公堂无一事，临川阁上日飞觞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":670,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"暮春得寒字","author":"赵秉文","text":"九日聊偷一日闲，三分春色二分阑。\n乡关梦里人空老，风雨夜来花更残。\n乍坼瓮泥糕酒熟，未开火禁粥饧寒。\n何时投劾归田去，杨柳阴中把钓竿。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":671,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"赵秉文","text":"十日秋霖不出门，门前流水似江村。\n墙头新竹大于母，砌下老桐今有孙。\n泽雁背飞惊吹急，濠鱼逆上避河浑。\n秋风未得乘槎便，拟控扶摇北海鹍。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":672,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"百塔","author":"赵秉文","text":"松林横截东南野，兰若斜连子午庄。\n平楚风烟开鄠杜，断碑岁月自隋唐。\n楼头山入诗人座，砌下泉分衲子房。\n更欲秦川穷胜槩，却从高塔望云阳。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":673,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"过石氏园","author":"赵秉文","text":"石氏园亭竹一围，眼前胜事只心知。\n幽禽有语能留客，流水无情自入池。\n客里岁华将尽日，梅边春信独来时。\n醉吟吟后无吟者，又得闲闲一首诗。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":674,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"上巳游西园分韵得兰字与杨礼部携同院诸公赋二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"相逢草草即杯盘，谁识吾曹个里欢。\n燕蹴檐花堕茵席，鱼摇波日动栏干。\n无穷照影溪溪柳，不住吹香畹畹兰。\n已属清明连上巳，更容飞盖接鹓鸾。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":675,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"上巳游西园分韵得兰字与杨礼部携同院诸公赋二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"跨凤骑麟玉笋班，蹇驴不作杜陵酸。\n已烦茧纸书陈迹，更许仙舟泛碧澜。\n酒令致师严细柳，诗朋鏖战剧皋兰。\n鳌头却返瀛洲去，梦觉扬州鹤背宽。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":676,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"挽刘云卿","author":"赵秉文","text":"人物于今叹渺然，如君才德几人全。\n忠言唐介初还阙，道学东莱不假年。\n黄壤苦埋经世志，青毡未了读书缘。\n西园酬唱空陈迹，泪洒南风擘素笺。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":677,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杨尚书宫直雪诗拟应制作某时在假闻而和之二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"霰雪霏霏点玉英，玉堂铃索峭寒生。\n也应天上多珂叶，无赖人间有化城。\n兔苑因而贤者乐，羊羔加以圣之清。\n吾曹安预筹边事，且及新年贺太平。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":678,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杨尚书宫直雪诗拟应制作某时在假闻而和之二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"黄昏陡觉峭寒生，漏涩铜壶第几更。\n未放六花齐苑树，先留半月抹宫城。\n一陶风俗还纯素，尽领乾坤入太清。\n应是上方观下界，放教双眼一时明。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":679,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"二月见梅花","author":"赵秉文","text":"不应开处避严冬，无赖春寒雪尚封。\n纵使风霜欺尔瘦，可能桃李为君容。\n庞眉都尉嗟何晚，飞骑将军叹不逢。\n毕竟荣枯无定在，此花劝汝倒金钟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":680,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"春寒花较迟","author":"赵秉文","text":"吟怀常恨负芳时，及至春来雪尚滋。\n榆荚半含椒粒色，柳条未变曲尘丝。\n墙阴更觉花开晚，水冷应知雁到迟。\n惭愧蓬莱老仙伯，已回和气入新诗。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":681,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"残梅","author":"赵秉文","text":"寒梅不作白头新，相对依依似故人。\n要伴宾鸿并社燕，未随流水与红尘。\n空枝拟折犹堪嗅，残蕊重看不厌频。\n自是东皇催鼎食，无情风雨不关春。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":682,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杏花","author":"赵秉文","text":"香传微雨隔帘栊，十载航船不负公。\n愁见馀春纷雪白，且看初日眩霞红。\n两株副使莺吟里，一色新郎马足中。\n投老安能知许事，一鞭农事趁春风。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":683,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"庆学士叔献七十寿二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"乞得闲身七十馀，知几初不为鲈鱼。\n胸中幸有平边策，林下聊观养性书。\n收拾云山归蜡屐，卷藏事业入篮舆。\n君王拊髀思颇牧，未许先生作隐居。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":684,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"庆学士叔献七十寿二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"小筑龙潭德不孤，卢鸿新有草堂图。\n四朝人物今谁在，二老风流与我俱。\n把酒笑谈犹解醉，上山筋力不须扶。\n文章不逐年龄改，能为开兴作颂无。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":685,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"访天宁周老","author":"赵秉文","text":"敝策羸童负束书，清晨渺渺独骑驴。\n乍辞天上尚书履，来访人间大士居。\n览镜年年非复我，照溪处处得逢渠。\n从今莫讶经过数，乞得闲身颇自如。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":686,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"春游四首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"草荒一径抱村斜，日暮初归拜扫车。\n犹有饥鸦来攫肉，觇人飞下杜梨花。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":687,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"春游四首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"无数飞花送小舟，蜻蜓款立钓丝头。\n一溪春水关何事，皱作风前万叠愁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":688,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"春游四首 其三","author":"赵秉文","text":"树藏修竹竹藏门，门外清流几股分。\n行过小桥人不见，背阴花气隔墙闻。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":689,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"春游四首 其四","author":"赵秉文","text":"烟外丝丝风柳斜，春光也自到天涯。\n太平有象村村酒，寒食无家处处花。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":690,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"题扇头","author":"赵秉文","text":"文书勾引黑甜乡，倦枕抛书午梦长。\n梦里棋声惊雨雹，觉来窗隙有斜阳。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":691,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"平湖戏鸭图","author":"赵秉文","text":"平湖飞下蹙双纹，翻动江南水底云。\n尽日自来还自去，尘埃满眼不如君。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":692,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"暮归","author":"赵秉文","text":"贪看孤鸟入重云，不觉青林雨气昏。\n行过断桥沙路黑，忽从电影得前村。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":693,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"正觉院","author":"赵秉文","text":"斋时一钵僧上堂，履声如水度秋窗。\n斜阳满地槐阴薄，幽鸟飞来施食幢。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":694,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"登嵩顶","author":"赵秉文","text":"危蹑嵩山顶上来，五髯龙对八仙台。\n不知眼界阔多少，直尽黄河一曲回。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":695,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"少林","author":"赵秉文","text":"只么西来坐面墙，更无一法付神光。\n少林自有吹毛物，三十六峰如剑铓。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":696,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"石楼","author":"赵秉文","text":"月约风期屡往还，水声山色石楼间。\n大家也入香山去，那个心如白傅闲。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":697,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"嵩山道中二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"为爱青山懒著鞭，吟诗时作鹤头偏。\n蓦然得句惊飞鸟，扑簌岩花堕马前。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":698,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"嵩山道中二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"屋头山色静无埃，竹里柴门水际开。\n惊怪篱中犬迎吠，有人知自碧峰来。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":699,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"题南城楼","author":"赵秉文","text":"楼上遥看郊外村，不须骑马坐平分。\n人家应在青山外，时有归牛下白云。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":700,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"香岩寺壁","author":"赵秉文","text":"一夕秋风变素商，萧萧云物换新凉。\n片云不作前溪雨，飞过高城有底忙。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":701,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"题扇头","author":"赵秉文","text":"魏三句里数声橹，秦七词中万点鸦。\n好在团团明月底，一弯流水几人家。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":702,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"三学院对月","author":"赵秉文","text":"何年觐佛朝天子，各以宝花楼阁俱。\n为问上方银世界，不知有此夜寒无。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":703,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"清居寺五杉亭观子野留题","author":"赵秉文","text":"五杉今日祗三株，曾是诗人叹息馀。\n君去我来杉尚在，断肠君没见君书。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":704,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"回春谷","author":"赵秉文","text":"冰崖雪柱道人家，谷榜回春事巳夸。\n却恐阳和在泉底，未春先发忍冬花。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":705,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"秘魔岩","author":"赵秉文","text":"铁锁关藏五百龙，文殊游戏作神通。\n山僧要辨金刚眼，莫谓鱼虾在此中。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":706,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"登万寿阁","author":"赵秉文","text":"中州之山台山高，遍寻五顶无乃劳。\n老去看山无脚力，直凭一阁了秋毫。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":707,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"马头","author":"赵秉文","text":"天外乱山围旷野，水边孤塔背层城。\n马头才指桑乾路，愁见行人问去程。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":708,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}}]